guide=['# B06–B09: Power-control parts to list and source','',
'**PHASE 1: MATERIALS BUYING, Step 14 — 15 October 2026.** The user will assemble the controls with guidance. HFRY60SS is the confirmed planning basis. This is a procurement list and functional explanation, not instructions to energize mains wiring. Keep the machine layout unchanged.','',
'## What the four groups mean','',
'- **B06 — Normal fryer switching:** One power contactor K1. A contactor is an electrically operated power switch; its coil receives a small control-power supply, and its separate main contacts switch the heater circuit.','- **B07 — Independent emergency power removal:** One power-stop contactor K0 and the reused A09 emergency-stop button. K0 stops heater and motor-supply power through a hardwired circuit. K1 manages normal cooking. These two functions are separate; neither ordinary contactor alone establishes certified safety performance.','- **B08 — Low-voltage control parts:** Interface relay, compatible coil supply, hardware RESET, suppression and control-branch wiring/protection.','- **B09 — Mains installation materials:** Suitable protection, enclosure, DIN rail, covered terminals/earth bar, rated cord/plug/socket and strain relief.','',
'## Detailed listing','',
'LISTED prices were observed. ESTIMATE figures are unverified small-material allowances and must be checked locally. Quote needed means no reliable price for the correct variant was verified. Fees are excluded.','',
'| ID | Item / specification | Qty | PHP price | Role / selection condition |','| --- | --- | ---: | --- | --- |']
for x in parts:
    cost='Quote needed' if x['price'] is None else f"{x['price']:,.2f}"
